This product is a web-based rebuild of the Dyad app-builder concept
(https://github.com/dyad-sh/dyad, Apache-2.0):

- The agent system prompt structure and guidance blocks (role, tool-calling
  rules, file-editing tool selection with the search/replace fallback rule,
  app lifecycle guidance, development workflow) are ported from Dyad's
  src/prompts/local_agent_prompt.ts and adapted to a cloud-sandbox runtime.
- The core agent tool set and semantics (write_file, search_replace,
  read_file, list_files, grep, run_command, restart_app,
  reinstall_and_restart_app, add_dependency, read_logs, set chat title)
  follow Dyad's local agent tool design.

